  "mermaidCode": "sequenceDiagram\n  autonumber\n  participant p0 as 交付系统\n  participant p1 as 支付宝商户平台\n  p0->>p1: 请求创建alipay.trade.create\n  activate p1\n  Note over p1: 关键参数out_trade_no、total_amount、subject、product_code、op_app_id、buyer_id\n  p1-->>p0: 返回创建信息\n  deactivate p1\n  Note over p1: 关键参数：trade_no，记录该trade_no是预付款还是尾款\n  p0->>p1: 请求撤销alipay.trade.cancel\n  activate p1\n  Note over p1: 关键参数：out_trade_no、trade_no\n  p1-->>p0: 返回撤销信息\n  deactivate p1\n\n  %% Links\n  %% [统一收单交易创建接口] https://open.alipay.com/api/detail?preProductName=JSAPI%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98&productName=JSAPI%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98&preCode=I1080300001000060370&code=I1140300001000013424&index=1 (used in: 请求创建alipay.trade.create)\n  %% [统一收单交易撤销接口] https://open.alipay.com/api/detail?preProductName=JSAPI%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98&productName=JSAPI%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98&preCode=I1080300001000060370&code=I1140300001000013424&index=1 (used in: 请求撤销alipay.trade.cancel)\n"
